    { "type": "text", "id": "pr_noworkers_t", "x": 1050, "y": 2010, "width": 280, "height": 60, "text": "workers: NOWHERE\nno host runs evidence /\ninference / resolution loops", "originalText": "workers: NOWHERE\nno host runs evidence /\ninference / resolution loops", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "strokeColor": "#b91c1c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 700021, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 700022, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": "pr_noworkers", "lineHeight": 1.25 },
    { "type": "text", "id": "pr_env", "x": 40, "y": 2095, "width": 1300, "height": 65, "text": "env on Vercel: OPENVERDICT_RELEASE_MANIFEST=config/release.testnet.json, DATABASE_URL (Neon), SUI_OPERATOR_SECRET_KEY,\nOPENVERDICT_AGENT_SEED, GONKA_ROUTER_API_KEY, OPENVERDICT_PUBLIC_WRITES, PGLITE_DATA_DIR, NEXT_PUBLIC_ENOKI_API_KEY,\nNEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID (baked at build). Blank values count as unset (readEnv). Five stacked deploy faults were\nfixed on 08-29 to reach a healthy /api/status: see docs/CHECKPOINT-2026-08-29.md.", "originalText": "env on Vercel: OPENVERDICT_RELEASE_MANIFEST=config/release.testnet.json, DATABASE_URL (Neon), SUI_OPERATOR_SECRET_KEY,\nOPENVERDICT_AGENT_SEED, GONKA_ROUTER_API_KEY, OPENVERDICT_PUBLIC_WRITES, PGLITE_DATA_DIR, NEXT_PUBLIC_ENOKI_API_KEY,\nNEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID (baked at build). Blank values count as unset (readEnv). Five stacked deploy faults were\nfixed on 08-29 to reach a healthy /api/status: see docs/CHECKPOINT-2026-08-29.md.", "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "strokeColor": "#64748b", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 700023, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 700024, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25 },

